  "properties": {
    "title": "Vector Tiles Cartography: Elevate your maps with JSON tricks",
    "description": "Unlock the full potential of Vector Tile Cartography with the power of JSON. While working with JSON might be confusing at first, the goal of this talk is to help you understand the basic syntax and how you can leverage it to make beautiful maps.\r\n\r\nWe will learn the basics of a style.json file, the crucial document that defines the map as per the MapLibre GL JS style spec. Using JSON syntax snippets, we will navigate through specific MapTiler cartography designs that you can reuse every time you make a map.",
